    {
      "chunk": {
        "id": "34f119b0321a0705",
        "text": "Heading-aware sections\n\nA heading-aware chunker starts a new chunk at every heading and carries the heading path into the chunk metadata. This only works when the parser reports headings. A plain text extractor returns every line as a paragraph, so the chunker sees one long section and falls back to its token budget.\n\nOverlap and its cost",
        "embed_text": null,
