    {
      "chunk": {
        "id": "862225532f622ea7",
        "text": "What to measure\n\nCompare strategies on the same parsed document. Count chunks, look at the token distribution, and check recall at ten on a fixed question set. A strategy that wins on one corpus can lose on another, so the comparison is the result, not the ranking.",
