    {
      "chunk": {
        "id": "f5c1c62c9cc10944",
        "text": "Recursive character splitting\n\nRecursive splitting tries a list of separators in order: blank lines, then single newlines, then sentence ends, then spaces. It only falls back to a finer separator when a piece is still larger than the budget. The result respects paragraphs where it can and sentences where it must, which is why it is the default in most frameworks.\n\nHeading-aware sections",
